# Implement reversible mailbox actions

## Goal

Add controlled organization and state changes with recovery paths.

## Required work

- Mark messages read and unread.
- Apply and remove labels.
- Archive and move messages.
- Move messages to trash and restore them.
- Specify partial failure for batch operations.

## Acceptance criteria

- Every action declares its inverse or recovery behavior.
- Batch results identify success and failure per item.
- Repeated requests obey documented idempotency semantics.
- Permanent deletion remains a distinct disabled capability.

## Evidence

- State-transition tests
- Batch partial-failure tests
